<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #fff;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .header img {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .header p {
            margin: 5px 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .content h4 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .content table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .content td {
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .content .details td {
            padding: 10px 20px;
        }

        .card {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        .card-body {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .card-body h5 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .summary {
            padding: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .summary h6 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
        }

        .summary table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .summary td {
            padding: 5px;
            border: none;
        }

        .summary .text-right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .footer {
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Journey Junction</h2>
            <p>180 Ang Mo Kio Ave 8, Singapore 569830<br>+65 6451 5115</p>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h4>Customer Details</h4>
            <table class="details">
                <tr>
                    <td><strong>Date:</strong> {{visitor.createdAt}}<br><strong>Payment type:</strong> Credit Card
                        {{visitor.cardType}}<br><strong>Delivery type:</strong> E-Ticket(s) via Email</td>
                    <td><strong>Invoice ID:</strong> #{{visitor.invoiceid}}<br><strong>E-mail:</strong>
                        {{visitor.email}}<br><strong>Phone:</strong>+{{visitor.countryCode}} {{visitor.phone}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table> <br>
            {{#each userCart}}
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5>{{attraction.location}}</h5>
                    <p>Date: {{dateOfAttraction}}<br>Ticket(s): </span><br>{{#ifNotEquals noOfAdults
                        '0'}}{{noOfAdults}}
                        x General Admission - Adult (13 years
                        old and above){{/ifNotEquals}}<br>{{#ifNotEquals noOfChild '0'}}{{noOfChild}} x
                        General
                        Admission - Child (12 years
                        old and below){{/ifNotEquals}}
                    </p>
                    <p><strong>Cost:</strong> ${{costOfAttraction}}</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/each}}
        </div>
        <div class="summary">
            <h6>Summary</h6>
            <table>
                <tr>
                    <td>Subtotal:</td>
                    <td class="text-right">${{totalCost}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Booking Fee: <span class="font-weight-normal">(25%)</span></td>
                    <td class="text-right">$2.00</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Total:</td>
                    <td class="text-right"><strong>${{totaltotal}}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Tax Inclusive: GST (9%)</td>
                    <td class="text-right">${{includegst}}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <h3>Terms and Conditions</h3>
            <p>1. All tickets are non-refundable and non-transferable.</p>
            <p>2. Please carry a valid ID proof along with the ticket for entry to the attraction.</p>
            <p>3. Entry to the attractions is subject to the attraction's policies and guidelines.</p>
            <p>4. The company is not responsible for any loss or damage caused during the visit to the attractions.</p>
            <p>5. In case of any dispute, the decision of the company will be final and binding.</p>
            <p>6. Please arrive at the attraction at least 15 minutes before the scheduled time.</p>
            <p>7. If eligible, any changes to the booking must be made at least 24 hours in advance.</p>
            <p>8. By purchasing the ticket, you agree to abide by all the terms and conditions mentioned above.</p>
            <p>&copy; 2024 Journey Junction. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>